  ["Ik2"] = "Beware the foul undead!",
  ["Ik3"] = "A weapon of myth and legend. It was lost in ancient times ... perhaps lost forever.",
  ["Ik4"] = "Yenny, known as the Gentle, was one of most powerfull magicwielders in ancient times and known throughout the world for her mercy and kindness.",
  ["Ik5"] = "I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik6"] = "I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik7"] = "I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik8"] = "I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik9"] = "Many perished in their battles against evil, some went mad, not able to stand their nightmares any longer. Others were seduced by the darkness.",
  ["IkA"] = "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["IkB"] = "It was a pleasure to help you, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["IkC"] = "Hello. How may I help you |PLAYERNAME|? Ask me for a {trade} if you want to buy something. I can also explain the {mail} system.",
  ["IkD"] = "See you my friend.",
  ["IkE"] = "You are....kind of tall! Hello.",
  ["IkF"] = "I don't see how you could help me. I'm in deep, deep trouble. I'm accused of having stolen a {ring} from Rerun, but I haven't.",
  ["IkG"] = "WHAT?! I can't believe it. You saved my life... well, at least one week of it 'cause that would have been the time I had to spend in jail. If you want to, you can pass the door now and take a look at the northern mines. Have fun!",
  ["IkH"] = "Maybe Grombur knows more than me. The thing is he won't talk to me, and he will surely not accuse his best friend as a liar. What a dilemma!",
  ["IkI"] = "He's a miner in the southern wing. Maybe he has lost the ring there... but even if I find the ring, no one will believe me. Someone should talk to Grombur. He's Rerun's best friend.",
  ["IkJ"] = "He's a good emperor but I doubt he is wise enough to see the truth behind that false accusation against me. If just someone would find out the truth about that whole mess.",
  ["IkK"] = "See you my friend.",
  ["IkL"] = "Keep a stiff upper lip!",
  ["IkM"] = "Ah, another diciple of the extreme... surviving the icy outdoors? Let me {help}! If you need some first aid out here, I can provide {healing} or grant you an {enhanced} blessing!",
  ["IkN"] = "Keep a stiff upper lip!",
  ["IkO"] = "Woof! <wiggle>",
  ["IkP"] = "<sniff> Woof! <sniff>",
  ["IkQ"] = "Woof! <wiggle>",
  ["IkR"] = "Hm? Oh! Oh, yes a... visitor! Intruder? Benefactor...? Wha- what are you? If you want to pass through this cave, I may have to disappoint you. Or maybe not. It... depends. So, just passing through?",
  ["IkS"] = "Well, bye then.",
  ["IkT"] = "Psst, not that {loud}.",
  ["IkU"] = "Welcome, pilgrim. How may I {help} you? Are you in need of {healing}?",
  ["IkV"] = "Come back soon!",
  ["IkW"] = "Welcome, welcome! Have a seat! If you like a drink or something to eat, just ask me for a {trade}!",
  ["IkX"] = "Hey, where are you going? We've just started!",
  ["IkY"] = "Welcome to Carlin Furniture Store, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["IkZ"] = "Farewell, I hope you were satisfied with our service.",
  ["Ika"] = "Hello, hello, |PLAYERNAME|! Please come in, look, and buy! If you like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}!",
  ["Ikb"] = "Um yeah, good day.",
  ["Ikc"] = "A shadow preceded you. You wish?",
  ["Ikd"] = "You don't have it...",
  ["Ike"] = "Good Bye, |PLAYERNAME|",
  ["Ikf"] = "Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! Only rarely I can welcome {visitors} these days.",
  ["Ikg"] = "How do you know? Did you go into the infested area?",
  ["Ikh"] = "What a pity! Let me know when you managed to get in there. Maybe I can help you when we know what we are dealing with.",
  ["Iki"] = "No then.",
  ["Ikj"] = "Ah, the curse of the Plains of Havoc, the hidden beast, the unbeatable foe. I've been living here for years and I'm sure this is only a myth.",
  ["Ikk"] = "There are many tales about the fearsome Hugo. It's said it's an abnormality, accidentally created by Yenny the Gentle. It's half demon, half something else and people say it's still alive after all these years.",
  ["Ikl"] = "Yenny, known as the Gentle, was one of the most powerful wielders of magic in ancient times. She was known throughout the world for her mercy and kindness.",
  ["Ikm"] = "Would you like to buy a The Holy Tible for 1000 gold?",
  ["Ikn"] = "You need to complete the quest for the book first before you can buy The Holy Tible.",
  ["Iko"] = "Here is your The Holy Tible.",
  ["Ikp"] = "You do not have enough money.",
  ["Ikq"] = "You better don't return here until you've defeated the Demon Oak.",
  ["Ikr"] = "A demon oak?!? <mumbles some blessings> May the gods be on our side. You'll need a {hallowed axe} to harm that tree. Bring me a simple {axe} and I'll prepare it for you.",
  ["Iks"] = "I don't believe a word of it! How rude to lie to a monk!",
  ["Ikt"] = "Ahh, you've got an axe. Very good. I can make a hallowed axe out of it. It will cost you... er... a donation of 1,000 gold. Alright?",
  ["Iku"] = "You have to first talk about {demon oak} or the {mission} before we continue.",
  ["Ikv"] = "Let's see....<mumbles a prayer>....here we go. The blessing on this axe will be absorbed by all the demonic energy around here. I presume it will not last very long, so better hurry. Actually, I can refresh the blessing as often as you like.",
  ["Ikw"] = "There is no axe with you.",
  ["Ikx"] = "There is not enough of money with you.",
  ["Iky"] = "This ancient order was created by a circle of wise humans who were called 'The {Dreamers}'. The order became {extinct} a long time ago.",
  ["Ikz"] = "That's where we are. The world of Tibia.",
