  ["IlA"] = "I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["IlB"] = "Now, it is |TIME|.",
  ["IlC"] = "They learned the ancient art of {dreamwalking} from some elves they befriended.",
  ["IlD"] = "While the dreamwalkers of the elves experienenced the brightest dreams of pleasure, the humans strangely had dreams of {dark omen}.",
  ["IlE"] = "They dreamed of doom, destruction, talked to dead, tormented souls, and gained unwanted insight into the {schemes of darkness}.",
  ["IlF"] = "They figured out how to interpret their dark dreams and so could foresee the plans of the dark gods and their minions.",
  ["IlG"] = "Using this knowledge they formed an order to thwart these plans, and because they battled their nightmares as brave as knights, they named their order accordingly.",
  ["IlH"] = "It is rumoured to open the entrance to the pits of inferno, also called the nightmare pits. Even if I knew about this secret I wouldn't tell you.",
  ["IlI"] = "Before the battles raged across them, they were called the fair plains.",
  ["IlJ"] = "Take care, it's dangerous out there.",
  ["IlK"] = "It was a pleasure to help you, |PLAYERNAME|.",
