  ["JGb"] = "Dedicated to all women who bravely and cleverly defeated the",
  ["JGc"] = "Deep in the heart of the Kha'labal the dreaded hyena king has its lair. This legendary beast is much larger than any other specimen of its race, surpassing lions and even elephants in size, and it can tear a man apart in seconds with its enormous, razor-sharp teeth. What's more, the hyena king is said to be truly immortal, for it has been sighted time and again by numerous travellers and merchants. Many a caravan is said to have fallen prey to this ferocious beast, and it is widely believed to have amassed untold treasures over the centuries.",
  ["JGd"] = "describe the demonic rulers",
  ["JGe"] = "desecration! This entity, which was two and one nevertheless, observed now the works of his companion in infinity.",
