  ["JGg"] = "devised dissolved in the void even before it was completed.",
  ["JGh"] = "Diary of Hengis Wulfson\\n...\\nI can only hope I can escape the\\ncyclops someday. For now I have\\noccupied their chief with an attempt\\nto learn to read and write, but for\\nhow long?\\nI'm so desperate.\\nWhat a foolish idea to travel here to\\nsearch the famous treasures of this\\nancient, knightly order.\\nI wish I had never heard about it.\\nI wish I had never sung that song.\\nNo clue how many unfortunate souls I\\nhave lured to death with it.",
  ["JGi"] = "... died but I could make it to the throne. My wards are holding the howling ghosts and spectres at bay for now and I prepare to unleash the powers of the throne ...",
  ["JGj"] = "different to the clear working of the Fardos, because mysteries and secrets were the aspects of his being. Uman and Zathroth",
  ["JGk"] = "Digging. Not a single trace of any door or even a window. Maybe home of some obscure cult of darkness? Maybe creatures of the night? A hideout for ghouls? Maybe I am working not hard enough. Hm, there seems to be a strange spot there at the wall, I can see it clearly from here. I shall try to push or pull it right away! Fame and riches, here I come!",
