  ["JLi"] = "Magic is Life, Life is Magic. Well, life is sex too, but this is a book for little children, so we wont talk about that here. But never forget that Magic is a jealous Lady and if you try to take her out of your head she will sure take revenge.",
  ["JLj"] = "magical powers and hurled a major part of the fire far away from himself. From the fire, which did not want to cool down,",
