  ["JMt"] = "not turn the tables. Some of them turned thereupon away from Uman and called Crunor their lord, in order to serve from then",
  ["JMu"] = "Note: these strange mushrooms are slowly gaining the upper hand. We have to do something about the leaks in the lower levels and fast.",
  ["JMv"] = "Now read on. If you stop the chant for longer than a breath, horrible shadows will stalk you and whisper foul dreams in your ears while you wake, the undead lord will raise his putrid hand to squash you, and the demons shall feast on your intestines while you still live to see it. now sing the following:",
  ["JMw"] = "Now there is no truning back. We will fight and there is just death or victory. Surrender or truce is no option!",
  ["JMx"] = "Now you only step in the teleporter, that is located near the resting rooms and you will be teleported on the surface.",
