  ["NNC"] = "Follow the north-eastern path into the forest. Beware of wolves!",
  ["NND"] = "This is not the way into the wolf forest. Stay on the southern path leading to the north-east!",
  ["NNE"] = "It seems plans changed. It's up to you now to find a dead war wolf and use the skinning knife on it to get some leather.",
  ["NNF"] = "Well.. that seems to be the poacher. Dead. Check his body - maybe he still has something that you can use.",
  ["NNG"] = "This hole leads into the wolves' den. Only enter if you have full health and food - this might be dangerous.",
  ["NNH"] = "This must be the chest with the book - but it's covered in flames!",
  ["NNI"] = "Right-click on the grey rune on the table and then left-click on the fire! You can't take the rune, but it works.",
  ["NNJ"] = "Go down the stairs to reach the vault. It smells like fire down there. Make sure you are healthy!",
  ["NNK"] = "The vault is on fire! There is almost no air in here. You don't have much time to find the book. Hurry!",
  ["NNL"] = "This is not the way to the troll caves. Go back down the stairs and walk north to find them.",
  ["NNM"] = "You've reached the newly dug troll tunnel. Take what you find in this chest and use it to bring down all support beams!",
  ["NNN"] = "You hear a crumbling below you. The tunnel collapsed. Vascalir will be pleased to hear about that.",
  ["NNO"] = "This is the crypt Vascalir was talking about. Explore it and search the coffins - one of them must hold a nice fleshy bone.",
  ["NNP"] = "This door seems to lead deeper into the crypt. Go downstairs and look for a special coffin. Beware of the walking dead!",
  ["NNQ"] = "Now that you have a fleshy bone, it's time to find out what Vascalir wanted with it.",
  ["NNR"] = "This is not the way to the crypt. Go south-west to reach the graveyard.",
  ["NNS"] = "This sarcophagus seems special. Sarcophagi are said to conserve meat longer than normal coffins - maybe you get lucky.",
  ["NNT"] = "You've found the wasp tower. Kill a wasp and use the flask you got from Vascalir on its corpse to retrieve some of its poison.",
  ["NNU"] = "Cross the bridge to the west and go south to reach the wasps' nest.",
  ["NNV"] = "Beware... you're approaching Kraknaknork's room. Once you enter, you have only 5 minutes to kill him before he throws you out.",
  ["NNW"] = "This chest should contain everything you need to infiltrate the fortress.",
  ["NNX"] = "You cannot hope to sneak past this guard. Maybe some distraction would help? You could try using the fleshy bone on him...",
